list.item:
•Hydrate patients, as appropriate, prior to and following the administration of ULTRAVIST [see Warnings and Precautions (

   5.3

)].

•ULTRAVIST can be used with 0.9% Sodium Chloride Injection in a power injector suitable for simultaneous injection of contrast [see Dosage and Administration (

   2.3

)]. However, do not mix or inject ULTRAVIST in intravenous administration lines containing other drugs or total nutritional admixtures.
